an><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">박사 등 </span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso-pagination: none; mso-padding-alt: 0pt 0pt 0pt 0pt\"><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff\"></span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt; mso-hansi-font-family: 돋움\">※ </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">Stipendium Hungaricum </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">프로그램에 참여하는 대학</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">전공과정</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">수학 기간</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">자격 조건</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">장학 조건 등 세부 사항은 붙임</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">2(10</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">쪽 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">Annex 2)</span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">참고 나</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">. </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">장학생 지원 내역 </span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">: </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">수업료 면제</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">월 생활비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">기숙사 또는 거주비</span><span lang=\"EN-US\" style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; FONT-FAMILY: 돋움; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LETTER-SPACING: 0pt; mso-ascii-font-family: 돋움; mso-font-width: 100%; mso-text-raise: 0pt\">, </span><span style=\"FONT-SIZE: 14pt; BACKGROUND: #ffffff; mso-fareast-font-family: 돋움\">의료보험</span></p><p class=\"0\" style=\"BACKGROUND: #ffffff; LINE-HEIGHT: 1.8; TEXT-AUTOSPACE: ; mso